<title>USA: Core Labs sees Saybolt accretive to EPS.</title>
<headline>Core Labs sees Saybolt accretive to EPS.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-01-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>Core Laboratories NV said its acquisition of privately held Saybolt International BV of the Netherlands will be accretive to earnings.</p>
<p>The company did not provide specific details and officials there were not immediately available to comment.</p>
<p>Core said Monday it would acquire Saybolt -- which provides lab and field services to test crude oil and petroleum products -- by issuing about 4.3 million Core shares. Core did not place a value on the transaction. The company's ADRs were up 1/4 in mid-morning trading at 20-1/2.</p>
<p>Saybolt had 1996 revenue of more than $100 million, Core said.</p>
